  "$note": "P2 phase-close parity sweep (brief P2.14 §1 b · §10 ruling 6). Data only. Shot on QC5, tree d, after ONE build at the P2-close tip; the controller judges money screens 01/02/02b/05/07/12/receipts himself, the rest is harness-judged + 1–2 spot checks per frame. Re-shoot after the U fix round with --states --state <touched> only.",
